  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4203.04 Thinning",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4203.04 Thinning. No person shall apply or solicit the application of any AIM coating that has been thinned to the extent that it exceeds the manufacturer’s thinning recommendation or the applicable VOC content limit specified in Env-A 4203.01(b), Table 4203-1.\n\nSource. #8695, eff 7-27-06; ss by #10736, eff 1-1-15; ss by #14202, eff 2-26-25",
